  <section id="governing-law">
    <h2>16. Governing law &amp; disputes</h2>
    <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of Victoria, Australia.</p>
    <p>The parties submit to the non-exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Victoria and the Federal Court of Australia for any dispute arising out of or in connection with these Terms.</p>
    <p>Before commencing litigation, the parties will attempt in good faith to resolve any dispute through senior-level negotiation for at least 30 days, except where urgent injunctive or equitable relief is required to protect a party's rights.</p>
