    <h3>Assignment</h3>
    <p>Manuva may assign these Terms in connection with a merger, acquisition, corporate reorganisation, or sale of substantially all of its assets. The Customer may assign these Terms only with Manuva's prior written consent, not to be unreasonably withheld. Any purported assignment in breach of this Section is void.</p>
